{"3453010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demonfall", "steam_appid": 3453010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>DEMONFALL</strong>, you play as one of the <strong> Knights</strong>, an ancient brotherhood of demon hunters long thought extinguished. Armed with a battered blade, grit, and the last flicker of hope humanity has, you carve your way through the ashes of a dead world, fighting back the hordes that should never have crossed over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMONFALL</strong> is a brutal RPG beat ’em up where every strike counts. Master fluid combat, chain devastating combos, time your dodges perfectly, and unleash upgrades that turn the tide in your favour. As you progress, you’ll grow stronger, unlock new abilities, and uncover the truth behind the failed Rapture — and why the heavens stayed silent.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>DEMONFALL</strong>, you play as one of the <strong> Knights</strong>, an ancient brotherhood of demon hunters long thought extinguished. Armed with a battered blade, grit, and the last flicker of hope humanity has, you carve your way through the ashes of a dead world, fighting back the hordes that should never have crossed over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMONFALL</strong> is a brutal RPG beat ’em up where every strike counts. Master fluid combat, chain devastating combos, time your dodges perfectly, and unleash upgrades that turn the tide in your favour. As you progress, you’ll grow stronger, unlock new abilities, and uncover the truth behind the failed Rapture — and why the heavens stayed silent.</p>", "short_description": "One year after the Rapture… nothing happened. No light. No salvation. No angels.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati